      "A ramp at the side entrance",
      "Use the side entrance"
    ],
    "notes": "Meaningful image."
  },
  {
    "id": "IMG-DECOR",
    "title": "Decorative image",
    "html": "<main><img alt=\"\"><p>Decorative image above.</p></main>",
